# Pairs with ChainCoversCommitted. An increment that finds a base-undecided
# saga still undecided does not hand it on, so the increment after it - taken
# once the saga committed, before its terminals land - no longer looks it up.
MODULE: ChainCoversCommittedUndecidedNotHandedOn
TARGET: ChainCoversCommitted
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a still-undecided saga is dropped from the increment's undecided set
PERTURBS: Drain

--- FIND
               und |-> Last.und /\ d0 = "none"])
--- REPLACE
               \* MUTATION: never handed on.
               und |-> FALSE])
--- END
